REM         download: https://search.earthdata.nasa.gov/search/granules?p=C2484079608-LPCLOUD&pg[0][v]=f&pg[0][qt]=2023-01-01T00%3A00%3A00.000Z%2C&pg[0][gsk]=-start_date&q=MCD12Q1&fi=MODIS&fdc=Land%2BProcess%2BDistributed%2BActive%2BArchive%2BCenter%2B%2528LPDAAC%2529&gdf=HDF!GeoTIFF&tl=1365827018.595!5!!&fst0=Land%20Surface&fst1=Climate%20Indicators
